Suddenly you heard roaring and a wolf with open muzzle appeared in front of you. That was a large beast, bigger than you.
You prepared to fight, but the monster did not attack. He loudly drew air in through his nose and spoke to you:
"Who are you? Where did you come from?"
"The owner of this house made me look like this. I came to settle the score with him," you honestly answered.
"Did you try on that wolf skin, too?" asked the beast, much softer this time.
"Yes."
"He transformed me the same way. Now I'm something like a watchdog to him," the werewolf said sadly. "I can never become a human again. Do you have a chance?"
"I don't know, but I hope so."